mapping "SOM.1" source="SOM" target="d6407" relationship=equivalent {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source SOM is a KSI activity node; its own children (SOM.AA.ZZ
 etc.) carry the explicit KSI crosswalk @ICF: d6407. Target ICF d6407
 has the identical Swedish name in the local ICF mirror —
 name-for-name equivalence. Both denote the single functional activity of making up sleeping
 places. Exact-equivalent tier : verified 1:1 equivalence via the KSI file's own crosswalk and
 the verbatim ICF term.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
